WEBVTT

00:00:23.918 --> 00:00:26.756
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:26.928 --> 00:00:29.297
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.712 --> 00:00:33.552
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.584 --> 00:00:34.751
♪ Right now light it up

00:00:34.792 --> 00:00:35.959
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.709 --> 00:00:48.668
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.709 --> 00:00:50.709
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.725 --> 00:00:55.219
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.417
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.436 --> 00:01:00.584
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.588 --> 00:01:03.846
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.876 --> 00:01:08.008
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.543 --> 00:01:12.327
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.339 --> 00:01:14.639
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.216 --> 00:01:19.353
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:21.779
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.828
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.829 --> 00:01:27.452
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:29.047
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.048 --> 00:01:31.566
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.567 --> 00:01:34.688
♪ Shine bright like
it's the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.766 --> 00:01:37.234
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.248 --> 00:01:39.118
♪ Your hands are now ♪

00:01:39.119 --> 00:01:40.652
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.691
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:45.936 --> 00:01:49.904
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.756 --> 00:01:53.175
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:59.846 --> 00:02:00.384
Quick, spread out!

00:02:07.229 --> 00:02:09.666
Most of the time, my White
Armoured Wings don't listen to me.

00:02:10.106 --> 00:02:11.649
Later, if you get hurt,

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:13.252
don't come and claim
medical fees from me.

00:02:26.108 --> 00:02:27.692
Mr. Gu, hurry up and help him.

00:02:27.911 --> 00:02:30.181
If it goes on,
that student will lose his life.

00:02:45.047 --> 00:02:46.080
Blinding Radiance!

00:02:47.667 --> 00:02:50.418
At such a close distance,
your Summoning Beast will be blinded.

00:02:51.156 --> 00:02:53.069
You're unlucky to fight me.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.904
-Great job!
-Well done!

00:02:58.958 --> 00:03:00.815
-Great job!
-You used a dirty trick!

00:03:02.162 --> 00:03:04.909
He used his talent well.

00:03:07.575 --> 00:03:08.832
How could this be possible?

00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:18.667
Don't you know that the Insect Monsters
have weak eyesight?

00:03:19.689 --> 00:03:20.901
You're fine. Quick!

00:03:20.905 --> 00:03:22.060
-The medical team!
-Okay...

00:03:23.733 --> 00:03:25.093
Have a taste of my Thunder Magic!

00:03:40.368 --> 00:03:41.821
What if you're a Thunder Talent mage?

00:03:52.846 --> 00:03:55.146
Who else? Come on!

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:05.524
Hai Dafu has lasted for three rounds.

00:04:05.877 --> 00:04:07.883
Looks like the Summoning Talent
has a big chance of winning.

00:04:08.073 --> 00:04:09.166
Not really.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:12.038
Look, the White Armoured Wings
is running out of energy.

00:04:28.864 --> 00:04:30.278
Hai Dafu can't hold out much longer.

00:04:30.476 --> 00:04:31.396
It is bad.

00:04:32.951 --> 00:04:35.028
Isn't that good?
He will be eliminated.

00:04:35.065 --> 00:04:37.132
There will be five people left
to compete for the Blood of Brute.

00:04:37.598 --> 00:04:38.598
Wang Li Ting.

00:04:38.599 --> 00:04:40.371
Did your magic teacher
teach you mathematics?

00:04:40.438 --> 00:04:41.680
We still have six people.

00:04:42.737 --> 00:04:45.104
Do we need to count him in?

00:04:46.103 --> 00:04:47.129
Don't say that.

00:04:47.183 --> 00:04:48.549
We have the same talent.

00:04:48.607 --> 00:04:49.967
Moreover, Mr. Jiang said...

00:04:49.993 --> 00:04:52.145
if we don't defeat at least 100 people,

00:04:52.212 --> 00:04:54.121
our resources
will be given to other talents.

00:04:54.489 --> 00:04:55.449
It's no big deal.

00:04:55.738 --> 00:04:57.258
I'll make up...

00:04:57.298 --> 00:04:58.658
for what you all lack.

00:04:59.264 --> 00:05:00.548
You're boasting.

00:05:00.758 --> 00:05:02.084
I'm boasting? Fine.

00:05:02.116 --> 00:05:02.806
If you can, go ahead.

00:05:04.489 --> 00:05:05.774
No, I...

00:05:05.904 --> 00:05:06.997
I'm bad at this.

00:05:07.184 --> 00:05:08.873
Why don't you go first, Mo Fan?

00:05:09.474 --> 00:05:10.966
My Summoning Beast got badly hurt.

00:05:11.209 --> 00:05:13.334
You should make up for me.

00:05:14.919 --> 00:05:16.492
We know that you're useless.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.973
Did everyone from Summoning Faculty die?

00:05:20.026 --> 00:05:21.311
Nobody is coming out to compete?

00:05:21.372 --> 00:05:22.465
Are you terrified?

00:05:24.946 --> 00:05:26.292
Quick, go!

00:05:45.862 --> 00:05:47.897
What is this?

00:05:47.988 --> 00:05:50.128
This Summoning Beast is not weaned?

00:05:54.971 --> 00:05:56.678
Let me tease this beast.

00:06:05.076 --> 00:06:06.978
No, don't tease it.

00:06:15.105 --> 00:06:16.398
When this beast grows up,

00:06:16.438 --> 00:06:17.744
you won't dare to act rashly.

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:20.115
I...

00:06:20.405 --> 00:06:22.325
I will practice diligently.

00:06:22.495 --> 00:06:24.802
I won't embarrass you in the future.

00:06:25.472 --> 00:06:26.886
My Archwolf.

00:06:26.912 --> 00:06:28.368
When will you wake up?

00:06:29.256 --> 00:06:31.598
It's fine. We'll try our best
to make it up.

00:06:31.772 --> 00:06:33.359
I'll enter the next round.

00:06:35.092 --> 00:06:36.319
What is his Summoning Beast?

00:06:36.359 --> 00:06:37.726
It's Zheng Bingxiao.

00:06:37.886 --> 00:06:39.037
He's quite famous.

00:06:39.372 --> 00:06:40.666
Looks like he's capable.

00:06:55.035 --> 00:06:56.058
It's a Stone Golem!

00:06:56.126 --> 00:06:57.004
Quick, let's escape!

00:07:05.252 --> 00:07:06.962
Everyone, I'm sorry.

00:07:06.963 --> 00:07:08.262
The Stone Golem
isn't afraid of being attacked.

00:07:08.408 --> 00:07:10.223
Even the Thunder Talent...

00:07:10.224 --> 00:07:11.740
won't hurt it.

00:07:11.779 --> 00:07:13.098
Stop that useless attack.

00:07:25.317 --> 00:07:26.648
Good job, Zheng Bingxiao.

00:07:26.688 --> 00:07:28.074
You deserve our class monitor.

00:07:28.174 --> 00:07:30.894
Look at the expression of students
from the Thunder and Fire Department.

00:07:31.461 --> 00:07:33.965
They are acting arrogant as
they are from the Assault Faculty.

00:07:34.381 --> 00:07:36.501
But, they encountered
Zheng Bingxiao's Summoning Beast,

00:07:36.739 --> 00:07:38.125
they became cowards.

00:07:43.432 --> 00:07:44.298
It's him?

00:07:44.969 --> 00:07:46.673
Xiaomian, there is someone
that you know?

00:07:47.155 --> 00:07:48.907
We don't really know each other.

00:07:49.786 --> 00:07:51.577
Master, I met the Level 2 mage
that was awakened...

00:07:51.578 --> 00:07:54.227
in our place one year ago.

00:07:55.645 --> 00:07:57.685
He's also a new student
of Mingzhu Academy?

00:07:58.777 --> 00:08:00.587
Yes, he was only awakened last year,

00:08:00.588 --> 00:08:02.419
but he successfully
entered Mingzhu Academy.

00:08:03.777 --> 00:08:05.137
What are you talking about?

00:08:05.177 --> 00:08:06.277
I don't know him,

00:08:06.464 --> 00:08:08.155
why are you asking me to date him?

00:08:10.719 --> 00:08:12.500
How dare he steal
Qin Xiaomian away from me?

00:08:12.849 --> 00:08:14.249
I'll make sure you will die in a terrible way.

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.940
The Summoning Talent is really awesome.
Just one of them can defeat us all.

00:08:19.158 --> 00:08:21.157
How can the other faculties survive?

00:08:21.422 --> 00:08:23.612
When we reach Level 2, maybe
we'll be more capable than them.

00:08:23.867 --> 00:08:24.907
When they train,

00:08:24.947 --> 00:08:26.294
they depend heavily on
their Summoning Beasts.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:29.260
Without expensive tools to assist them,

00:08:29.394 --> 00:08:31.564
it will be hard for them to capture
strong Summoning Beasts.

00:08:39.913 --> 00:08:42.345
Quick, look! That Stone Golem
can't hold on any longer.

00:08:46.109 --> 00:08:48.329
I concede defeat.
My Stone Golem is dying.

00:08:48.417 --> 00:08:51.168
I can't ignore its safety
to get the reward.

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.625
The Stone Golem should be the strongest
Summoning Beast in their faculty.

00:08:58.988 --> 00:09:00.094
If I'm not mistaken,

00:09:00.161 --> 00:09:01.798
they have a Bone-eating Ghoul,

00:09:02.114 --> 00:09:03.848
Which it is ferocious.

00:09:04.826 --> 00:09:07.079
Then let's choose the easy one to fight.

00:09:08.451 --> 00:09:10.358
The main character will
only appear at the end.

00:09:10.801 --> 00:09:12.308
Now, it's my turn.

00:09:21.659 --> 00:09:23.646
I don't think the rest of you
have the chance to compete.

00:09:29.238 --> 00:09:31.251
I heard that they have a quota

00:09:31.353 --> 00:09:32.782
That they have to defeat 100 of us.

00:09:32.954 --> 00:09:35.154
I think this Bone-eating Ghoul
will do half of the job.

00:09:35.235 --> 00:09:37.547
If they don't reach this quota,

00:09:37.667 --> 00:09:40.209
then their resources will be
given to the Earth Department?

00:09:40.265 --> 00:09:42.191
Of course. Capable people
get more resources.

00:09:42.367 --> 00:09:44.287
But, we can't defeat...

00:09:44.367 --> 00:09:45.601
that Bone-eating Ghoul.

00:09:49.869 --> 00:09:51.562
You don't have to thank me later.

00:09:51.819 --> 00:09:53.819
Thank you? Without any reason?

00:09:58.722 --> 00:09:59.776
It stinks!

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.176
Smell like a corpse.

00:10:02.808 --> 00:10:04.115
My Summoning Beast...

00:10:04.141 --> 00:10:06.106
eats not only corpses,
but also people alive.

00:10:06.755 --> 00:10:08.008
If you're brave enough,

00:10:08.061 --> 00:10:09.560
come and try to defeat it.

00:10:13.314 --> 00:10:16.122
This time, the Earth Department
will gain all the resources.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:18.055
Someone from the Earth Department
has the guts to compete with me?

00:10:18.814 --> 00:10:22.234
Fatty, do you know what
my Bone-eating Ghoul likes the most?

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.987
Someone with excess fat like you.

00:10:25.856 --> 00:10:27.150
If an ice...

00:10:27.189 --> 00:10:29.096
falls down from a height of 30 m,

00:10:29.132 --> 00:10:30.438
do you know how many pieces
will it break into?

00:10:30.664 --> 00:10:33.531
What are you talking about?
I think you're crazy.

00:10:35.501 --> 00:10:38.793
You should pray that
your Bone-eating Ghoul has strong bones.

00:10:39.134 --> 00:10:41.720
Or else, it will be hard
to clean the mess.

00:10:49.169 --> 00:10:50.337
Locking Ice!

00:10:51.948 --> 00:10:53.838
Level 2 magic?

00:10:55.175 --> 00:10:55.842
No!

00:11:03.373 --> 00:11:05.803
Mr. Gu, should we
control the situation?

00:11:06.195 --> 00:11:07.395
Since this is the Beasts Battle,

00:11:07.501 --> 00:11:08.802
injuries are inevitable.

00:11:09.309 --> 00:11:11.229
We have to let the students
gain experiences.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:12.802
The rest of you can
go against me together.

00:11:12.946 --> 00:11:14.173
Let's not waste time.

00:11:14.319 --> 00:11:16.688
-What should we do?
-Can anyone go against him?

00:11:17.428 --> 00:11:18.695
We can't defeat him.

00:11:18.947 --> 00:11:20.454
Why don't we go against him together?

00:11:20.546 --> 00:11:21.452
Let's do our best!

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:25.177
I'm not interested in you at all.

00:11:25.975 --> 00:11:28.257
There's one more left, right?
I'll leave him to you.

00:11:30.681 --> 00:11:32.548
There's one more left. He's weak.

00:11:32.668 --> 00:11:35.907
Buddies, let's go!
Or else, you won't get any resources.

00:11:37.925 --> 00:11:39.112
The Bone-eating Ghoul was defeated.

00:11:39.451 --> 00:11:40.737
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:11:41.143 --> 00:11:42.226
Let's go.

00:11:42.254 --> 00:11:43.985
Li Junwei, you're going to
challenge him?

00:11:44.301 --> 00:11:45.421
Any problem with that?

00:11:45.779 --> 00:11:47.319
Nothing.

00:11:47.511 --> 00:11:48.578
Good luck.

00:11:50.054 --> 00:11:52.391
The only student from Summoning Faculty,
accept our challenge.

00:11:53.174 --> 00:11:54.507
Don't be a coward.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:58.049
Come out!

00:12:01.753 --> 00:12:03.300
Mo Fan, don't go.

00:12:03.661 --> 00:12:04.674
I'll negotiate with them.

00:12:04.928 --> 00:12:06.659
The battle shall end now.

00:12:09.328 --> 00:12:11.190
-I can sense it.
-What?

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:13.351
My Archwolf.
It has waken up.

00:12:28.973 --> 00:12:30.733
Zheng Bingxiao defeated 25 people.

00:12:30.759 --> 00:12:32.409
He has the best results up to now.

00:12:32.805 --> 00:12:35.497
Our goal today depends on your mood.

00:12:40.722 --> 00:12:42.372
It's an Archwolf!

00:12:43.146 --> 00:12:45.660
It looks stronger now
than before.

00:12:52.784 --> 00:12:55.070
There's nothing to be afraid of.
It's just an Archwolf.

00:12:55.110 --> 00:12:56.443
It isn't a Bone-eating Ghoul.

00:12:56.753 --> 00:12:59.175
I don't think it's a normal Archwolf.

00:12:59.365 --> 00:13:00.445
Let's defeat it first.

00:13:00.618 --> 00:13:01.416
The Five Talents Formation!

00:13:07.593 --> 00:13:09.793
The Wind, Water, Thunder, Fire
and Earth Talent are all present.

00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:11.703
This time, you can attack
as much as you like.

00:13:12.489 --> 00:13:14.668
Datou, obstruct and pin it down.

00:13:15.097 --> 00:13:16.857
Wind magic, Floating shadow!

00:13:17.667 --> 00:13:18.920
Great, let's do it!

00:13:18.961 --> 00:13:21.121
Let's show the underlings before us...

00:13:21.175 --> 00:13:22.690
how well we cooperate in battle.

00:13:23.966 --> 00:13:24.633
Go ahead.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:26.940
Doudou!

00:13:27.457 --> 00:13:28.431
Water Magic, Protection!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.124
How can a level 3 Water Magic
fail to fend it off?

00:13:44.324 --> 00:13:46.258
Beast, have a taste of my Thunder Magic!

00:13:53.248 --> 00:13:54.115
Good job!

00:13:56.966 --> 00:13:58.873
These don't work.

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:01.345
Okay, it's your turn now.

00:14:06.306 --> 00:14:07.226
Quick, spread out!

00:14:13.859 --> 00:14:15.554
Doudou, come to my back!

00:14:17.695 --> 00:14:18.789
Wave Plane.

00:14:21.594 --> 00:14:22.941
I can't use my magic.

00:14:23.313 --> 00:14:24.740
We'll have to use
Self-defense Weapons.

00:14:25.504 --> 00:14:26.477
Wall of Vine!

00:14:34.636 --> 00:14:35.896
This student is capable.

00:14:36.165 --> 00:14:37.981
He used his Wave Plane to rescue...

00:14:37.981 --> 00:14:41.943
two of his teammates which couldn't
defend themselves and escape...

00:14:41.943 --> 00:14:44.070
from the Fire and
Thunder Department, then...

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:48.084
used a weapon to protect himself and
his Water Talent teammate behind him.

00:14:48.491 --> 00:14:50.660
That Archwolf's Sandstorm Volley...

00:14:50.834 --> 00:14:54.752
was obviously strong enough
to defeat them.

00:14:55.431 --> 00:14:58.381
But, he alone defused it.

00:14:58.971 --> 00:14:59.998
What a shame,

00:15:00.358 --> 00:15:01.558
at last, he was defeated.

00:15:01.922 --> 00:15:03.175
That Archwolf...

00:15:03.202 --> 00:15:05.353
can attack in three stages.

00:15:14.181 --> 00:15:15.035
Come back.

00:15:20.259 --> 00:15:22.471
This person is unbelievable.

00:15:25.117 --> 00:15:28.387
This Archwolf became stronger.

00:15:28.941 --> 00:15:30.034
Mo Fan, you did a great job!

00:15:30.181 --> 00:15:31.528
You can complete the quota.

00:15:32.346 --> 00:15:34.452
You're too optimistic.

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:37.640
You still need to defeat many people
to reach your quota.

00:15:37.885 --> 00:15:39.525
Resources can be stolen.

00:15:40.344 --> 00:15:41.784
You can either hide behind...

00:15:41.812 --> 00:15:44.959
and cowardly watch others
shine on stage...

00:15:45.824 --> 00:15:48.611
or try your best to
increase your ability...

00:15:48.912 --> 00:15:51.106
and amaze the world with
a single brilliant feat one day,

00:15:51.107 --> 00:15:52.445
attracting everyone's attention.

00:15:53.421 --> 00:15:55.275
Chancellor Xiao, I have a question.

00:15:55.901 --> 00:15:56.964
Go ahead.

00:15:57.185 --> 00:15:59.695
If the Summoning Faculty doesn't reach
the quota of defeating 100 people,

00:15:59.722 --> 00:16:01.963
for this semester, our resources
will be given to others.

00:16:02.461 --> 00:16:04.901
Isn't this unfair to our faculty?

00:16:05.586 --> 00:16:08.062
If we lose, our resources
will be given out to others.

00:16:08.135 --> 00:16:11.055
If we win, we will only get
our own resources.

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:15.651
We actually considered about this.

00:16:15.948 --> 00:16:18.121
Behind the standard of 100 mages,

00:16:18.134 --> 00:16:20.005
we also have another target for you.

00:16:20.339 --> 00:16:23.162
If the students of
the Summoning Faculty...

00:16:23.167 --> 00:16:26.126
can withstand the magic of 200 mages,

00:16:26.664 --> 00:16:29.824
then, all the training resources
for this semester...

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:31.904
will belong to your faculty.

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.252
How can they do this?

00:16:35.602 --> 00:16:36.469
Really?

00:16:36.741 --> 00:16:37.688
If that's the case,

00:16:37.876 --> 00:16:40.710
I want to tell everyone here,

00:16:41.225 --> 00:16:42.265
I will...

00:16:42.381 --> 00:16:44.568
use up more resources than normal mages.

00:16:44.648 --> 00:16:46.628
Hence, I apologise.

00:16:46.738 --> 00:16:48.809
I'll have to take up all your resources.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.800
What?

00:16:57.083 --> 00:17:00.918
♪ Until we start to fight keep alive ♪

00:17:00.918 --> 00:17:04.127
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:17:04.167 --> 00:17:07.126
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:17:07.148 --> 00:17:09.725
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:17:14.398 --> 00:17:16.653
♪ Every lonely journey I begin ♪

00:17:16.667 --> 00:17:18.709
♪ Is another mystery
this life gives me ♪

00:17:18.753 --> 00:17:20.868
♪ I can't escape my fate, but why? ♪

00:17:20.903 --> 00:17:24.136
♪ Who tipped the balance
of this season? ♪

00:17:24.626 --> 00:17:27.809
♪ Is the crushing blow necessary ♪

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.404
♪ For one to rise up and see? ♪

00:17:29.431 --> 00:17:32.071
♪ Fight on in this uphill battle ♪

00:17:32.072 --> 00:17:34.349
♪ Face the reality ♪

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:37.063
♪ Setting foot in this forbidden city ♪

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:40.395
♪ Breaking the rules that silence me ♪

00:17:41.133 --> 00:17:42.444
♪ The more I go against it ♪

00:17:42.488 --> 00:17:43.877
♪ The more certain I am ♪

00:17:43.878 --> 00:17:45.992
♪ As I follow my heart ♪

00:17:46.716 --> 00:17:47.886
♪ The wind blows ♪

00:17:47.887 --> 00:17:50.162
♪ I am soaring into the sky ♪

00:17:50.167 --> 00:17:51.043
♪ As we meet ♪

00:17:51.083 --> 00:17:53.208
♪ One time you fight the fear ♪

00:17:53.209 --> 00:17:54.710
♪ Fly to high ♪

00:17:54.751 --> 00:17:58.210
♪ Every drop of sweat
remembers how you have tried ♪

00:17:58.250 --> 00:17:59.959
♪ You are born to be the one ♪

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:01.918
♪ Who realize all desires ♪

00:18:01.918 --> 00:18:04.085
♪ Until we start to fight ♪

00:18:04.125 --> 00:18:05.417
♪ Keep alive ♪

00:18:05.417 --> 00:18:08.751
♪ No matter what they said
you must believe in yourself ♪

00:18:08.751 --> 00:18:11.669
♪ You will breaking through the night ♪

00:18:11.709 --> 00:18:15.168
♪ Fire in your eyes shining so bright ♪

00:18:15.709 --> 00:18:16.792
♪ Oh ♪

00:18:17.417 --> 00:18:21.043
♪ You're always standing by my side ♪
